// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Disgust 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Disgust :
"P2526564338" "The family has long had soldiers protecting this land and to have this happen to them is a disgrace."
// Disgust :
"P2215516421" "Their son, {First_Name}, a soldier within my battalion, is so overcome by distress that he cannot focus in battle.  I worry for the safety of my other men."
// Disgust :
"P2064834239" "It is as if that family is cursed.  Both of their sons have been lost in war...and now this."
// Disgust :
"P3660897981" "What makes matters worse is that the rest of my men are upset and unfocused.  They are threatening to take action into their own hands."
// Disgust :
"P1689342751" "The men see this act of desecration and their morale plummets.  I worry that if this continues, the war will be lost before they even enter another battlefield."
// Disgust :
"P2490511601" "One of the sages needs to commune with this ancestor and cannot do so without the remains.  Communication is key and without it, we lose precious time and resources to information."
// Disgust :
"P544558827" "Some of the women are very superstitious and fear the mystical repercussions of disturbing the long-dead.  They are becoming erratic and giving their husbands, my men, cause for concern.  I cannot have my men distracted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3664689146" "Romulus has sent his men to enact a most heinous and treacherous act.  In the night, his men broke into the sacred tomb of one of our townsfolk's ancestors and stole the remains!  This act is so distasteful that I struggle even now to speak it aloud to you.  You must return with those remains so that the family may set them to rest once more."
// AcceptString :
"P1329718939" "Accept task to retrieve {Last_Name} remains"
// SendOffString :
"P4158424582" "The {Last_Name} family are most devastated by this act.  {Disgust}<br><br><color orange>You have 30 minutes to complete this task.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P99101713" "Retrieve stolen remains"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2287393592" "The {Last_Name} family grieves even now at this horrific injustice.  You must move quickly before this devastation further impacts our fight."

